# --- Benchmark outputs ---
# Measured results and figures ARE tracked: the docs tables and plots are
# generated from them, so a checkout without them cannot reproduce the pages.
# Only raw sweep dumps stay out: those are timestamped, one per run, and
# accumulate. Curated results and every figure are tracked.
benchmarks/results/raw/
benchmarks/results/*_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]*.csv

# --- Docs build ---
docs/build/
docs/source/_build/
docs/_build/
docs/_build_test/

